  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1302.05 Form of Submissions. Any application, request, report, or supporting documents related thereto filed with the bureau for registration under, exemption from, or as required by any provision of RSA 356-A or these rules may be submitted in an electronic form or in paper form.\n\nSource. #12909, eff 10-24-19",
